  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Service Contract Communication and Visibility for 11th EDF Works Contracts in Cura&#xbf;ao</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;To design and implement a comprehensive communication and visibility strategy for the 11&lt;sup&gt;th&lt;/sup&gt; EDF EU-funded projects in Cura&#xe7;ao, ensuring the project&#xbf;s activities, outcomes, and impact are effectively communicated to stakeholders and the public, in compliance with EU guidelines. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;All activities must be carried out in &lt;strong&gt;close collaboration with the Ministry of General Affairs&lt;/strong&gt; and the &lt;strong&gt;Ministry of Traffic, Transport and Spatial Planning&lt;/strong&gt;, to ensure alignment with national priorities, facilitate effective stakeholder engagement, and maximize project visibility.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
